  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform rod of length <math><mi>l</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> is being rotated in a horizontal plane with a constant angular speed about an axis passing through one of its ends. If the tension generated in the rod due to rotation is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at a distance <math><mi>x</mi></math> from the axis, then which of the following graphs depicts it most closely?",
